<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n95555" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σμύχω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῡ]</span>, aor.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔσμυξα </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ-</span>) <i><span class="en">
			Il.
			9.653
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			<u>AP</u>
			5.253
		</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
			Paul.Sil.
		</span></i>) (simple <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σμῦξαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hsch.
				</span></i>
			):—
				Pass.
			, aor. 1
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσμύχθην </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ-</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				8.90
			</span></i>; aor. 2
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσμύγην <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῠ]</span>
			</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπ-</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>DMort.</u>
				6.3
			</span></i>: pf.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔσμυγμαι </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ-</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Hld.
				7.21
			</span></i>:— <i>burn in a slow, smouldering fire, make</i>
			a thing <i>smoulder away</i> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατασμύχω</span>): metaph. of grief, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τεῖρ᾽ ὀδύνη σμύχουσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					3.762
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῆρ ἄχεϊ σμύχουσα</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				446
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>smoulder away</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἴλιος πυρὶ σμύχοιτο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					22.411
				</span></i>
			; by the fires of love, <i><span class="en">
				Mosch.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				2.4
			</span></i>; by suspicion, <i><span class="en">
				Hld.
				1.16
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρετὸς -όμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					11.25
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σμύχονται σάρκες</span>
			<i>are shrivelled</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>SD</u>
				1.8
			</span></i>.</div>
